title: Authorizations › Queue › Search and filter
route: /authorizations
intro: The search box and the four menus (Payer, Request type, Status, Urgency), the help for the status names, the note on how the list is ordered, how filters combine and travel in the web address, what the page says when nothing matches, and the 'Nothing needs you today' messages that appear once requests have been sent or handled. Search and every filter work on the requests at the sites in view only.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: filters are kept while you move around the app, are written to the web address (?payer=, ?type=, ?status=, ?urgency=, ?q=, ?signal=1) and are cleared by Reset demo data. 'Nothing needs you today' shows in the Act now band once all five of its requests are sent or handled, and for the whole queue only when no request is left open at all.
---
screen fb "Filter bar under the figures\nSearch box, Payer, Request type, Status, Urgency, and a note on ordering"

group gS "Search"
  click sk "Press '/' anywhere\n(not while typing in a field)"
  process sf "Cursor jumps to the search box"
  input s1 "Type in 'Search by case ID or initials'"
  process sm "Matches the ID or the initials of a request at a site in view\nIgnores case, dots, dashes and spaces\n'r1042' and 'jm' both find R-1042 (J.M.)\nA request at the other site is never found"
endgroup

group gP "Payer"
  click p1 "Click 'Payer'"
  overlay p2 "Menu: All payers, Summit Medicaid HMO, Cardinal Health Plan, Evergreen, Beacon PPO, Harborview MA, Lakeshore Behavioral"
  input p3 "Pick a payer"
endgroup

group gQ "Request type"
  click ty1 "Click 'Request type'"
  overlay ty2 "Menu: All request types, Initial, Concurrent review, Reauthorization, Modification / extension, Retrospective"
  input ty3 "Pick a type"
endgroup

group gT "Status"
  click st1 "Click 'Status'"
  overlay st2 "Menu: All statuses, Waiting on you, Needs your input, Preparing, Ready to sign, With the payer, Denial route"
  input st3 "Pick a status"
  process st4 "'Waiting on you' = not sent yet, a denial to work, or a question for you\n'Needs your input' = requests flagged as needing you\nThe others = the request's phase (a request whose checks all passed counts as Ready to sign)"
  click sh "Hover or focus the info icon next to 'Status'\n'What the statuses mean'"
  overlay sh2 "Tooltip: Preparing is a draft, Ready to sign is ready for review, With the payer covers submitted, acknowledged, under review and info requested, Denial route is denied, Approved and Completed leave the queue\nEsc closes it"
endgroup

group gU "Urgency"
  click u1 "Click 'Urgency'"
  overlay u2 "Menu: All urgency, Act now, Due within 24 hours, Due this week"
  input u3 "Pick an urgency"
endgroup

process kb "In any menu: Up and Down move, Enter picks, Esc or a click outside closes it"
click ot "Hover or focus the info icon 'How the list is ordered' (right end of the bar, no label beside it)"
overlay ot2 "Tooltip: 'By band (how soon it is due), then waiting on you first, then soonest due, then lower approval chance.'\nEsc closes it"
process ap "Filters stack: a request must pass every one\nA menu that is not on its default turns green"
store keep "Filters are kept in the app for this session\nand written to the web address"
start dl "Open a link with filters in it\ne.g. /authorizations?payer=cardinal&type=retro"
process dl2 "The filters in the address are applied\nValues that are not menu options are ignored"
screen hd "Header: 'X of 56 open requests match these filters.'"
click clr "Click 'Clear filters'\n(appears once any filter is on)"
decision dAny "Any request left?"
screen res "Bands show only the matching requests\nBand counts follow"
screen emp "'No requests match these filters' and 'Clear filters'"
click ce "Click 'Clear filters' in the message"
process rs "Search empty, All payers, All request types, All statuses, All urgency, payer-signal filter off\nThe filters leave the web address"

decision dOpen "Are there any open requests at all?"
end e1 "Every band is listed again"
screen none "'Nothing needs you today' and 'Open Case Manager'"
decision dNow "Is Act now empty, with no search, payer or status filter on?"
screen nowE "Act now band stays, '(0 requests)'\n'Nothing needs you today · Everything here is sent or handled'\n(with one site in view: '· None open at Site B')"
click ocm "Click 'Open Case Manager'"
goto gCM "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Tracker of every active case"
goto gSig "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Cardinal payer signal"

fb --> sk --> sf --> s1
s1 --> sm
fb --> p1 --> p2 --> p3
fb --> st1 --> st2 --> st3 --> st4
fb --> u1 --> u2 --> u3
fb --> ty1 --> ty2 --> ty3
st1 --> sh
sh --> sh2
fb --> ot --> ot2
dl --> dl2 --> ap
ty3 --> ap
p2 -.-> kb
sm --> ap
p3 --> ap
st4 --> ap
u3 --> ap
ap --> keep
ap --> hd --> dOpen
ap --> clr --> rs
dOpen -->|Yes| dAny
dOpen -->|No| none --> ocm --> gCM
dAny -->|Yes| res
res -.-> dNow
dNow -->|Yes| nowE
dAny -->|No| emp --> ce --> rs
rs --> e1
fb --> gSig
